msgid "BlogLogistics"
msgstr "BlogLogistics"

msgid "Manage BlogLogistics plugin settings from the left sidebar."
msgstr "Hantera inställningar för BlogLogistics-tillägg från vänster sidofält."

msgid "Limited Blog Writing Access"
msgstr "Limited Blog Writing Access"

msgid "Settings saved."
msgstr "Inställningarna har sparats."

msgid "Recommended defaults restored."
msgstr "Rekommenderade standardinställningar har återställts."

msgid "These settings control what non-administrators and limited writing roles can do in wp-admin."
msgstr "Dessa inställningar styr vad icke-administratörer och begränsade skribentroller kan göra i wp-admin."

msgid "Limit wp-admin access for non-administrators"
msgstr "Begränsa wp-admin-åtkomst för icke-administratörer"

msgid "Redirect other non-administrator users away from wp-admin and hide the admin bar for them."
msgstr "Omdirigera andra icke-administratörer bort från wp-admin och dölj adminfältet för dem."

msgid "Keep limited writers away from media and publishing tools"
msgstr "Håll begränsade skribenter borta från media- och publiceringsverktyg"

msgid "Allow limited writers to write posts, but block media access, image insertion, publishing, and related workarounds."
msgstr "Tillåt begränsade skribenter att skriva inlägg, men blockera medieåtkomst, bildinfogning, publicering och relaterade kringgåenden."

msgid "This includes Media Library access, media uploads, the Media menu, Add Media, Featured Image, Site Logo, Insert from URL, media blocks, embeds, direct media HTML, and publishing attempts."
msgstr "This includes Media Library access, media uploads, the Media menu, Add Media, Featured Image, Site Logo, Insert from URL, media blocks, embeds, direct media HTML, and publishing attempts."

msgid "Keep limited writers away from comment moderation"
msgstr "Håll begränsade skribenter borta från kommentarsmoderering"

msgid "Remove Comments from wp-admin for limited writers and block direct access to comment moderation screens."
msgstr "Remove Comments from wp-admin for limited writers and block direct access to comment moderation screens."

msgid "If someone manually enters a comments URL, such as edit-comments.php, they are redirected back to the posts screen instead of seeing or moderating comments."
msgstr "If someone manually enters a comments URL, such as edit-comments.php, they are redirected back to the posts screen instead of seeing or moderating comments."

msgid "Hide Nelio Content tools from limited writers"
msgstr "Dölj Nelio Content-verktyg för begränsade skribenter"

msgid "Remove Nelio Content menu items from wp-admin for limited writers, including the Calendar item under Posts."
msgstr "Remove Nelio Content menu items from wp-admin for limited writers, including the Calendar item under Posts."

msgid "If someone manually enters a Nelio Content admin URL, they are redirected back to the Posts screen instead of seeing Nelio Content tools."
msgstr "If someone manually enters a Nelio Content admin URL, they are redirected back to the Posts screen instead of seeing Nelio Content tools."

msgid "Recommended defaults:"
msgstr "Rekommenderade standardinställningar:"

msgid "Limit wp-admin access: On"
msgstr "Limit wp-admin access: On"

msgid "Keep limited writers away from media and publishing tools: On"
msgstr "Keep limited writers away from media and publishing tools: On"

msgid "Keep limited writers away from comment moderation: On"
msgstr "Keep limited writers away from comment moderation: On"

msgid "Hide Nelio Content tools from limited writers: On"
msgstr "Hide Nelio Content tools from limited writers: On"

msgid "Save Settings"
msgstr "Spara inställningar"

msgid "Restore recommended defaults"
msgstr "Återställ rekommenderade standardinställningar"

msgid "This turns all protections back on."
msgstr "Detta slår på alla skydd igen."

msgid "You do not have permission to manage these settings."
msgstr "Du har inte behörighet att hantera dessa inställningar."
